    "title": "Three systems by three layers",
    "description": "Brainstorm, in progress. Columns are the user, the external system and the internal system. Rows are the layers: Purpose, Dynamics, Foundation. Every tile runs the same five phases and has the same ports. Within a column, a Change opens the tile below and that tile reports back up.",
